ial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 682.342529296875, "y0": 1334.53125, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 1375.3125, "text": "Q表以及各种数字式测量仪表", "score": 0.9967958835455087, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 685.1162719726562, "y0": 1395.0, "x1": 1449.284423828125, "y1": 1431.5625, "text": "声焊接以及电子医疗器械也都广泛应用振荡器。", "score": 0.9976959001450312, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 757.2337646484375, "y0": 1452.65625, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1490.625, "text": "振荡器的种类很多。从所采用", "score": 0.9980580669182998, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 687.8900146484375, "y0": 1510.3125, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 1546.875, "text": "可以把振荡器分为反馈式振荡", "score": 0.9964142166651212, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 685.1162719726562, "y0": 1563.75, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 1601.71875, "text": "反馈式振荡器。根据振荡器所", "score": 0.9986608303510226, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 680.9556274414062, "y0": 1615.78125, "x1": 1654.5418701171875, "y1": 1662.1875, "text": "波振荡器与非正弦波振荡器。本书只介绍正弦波振荡器。", "score": 0.9974213862419128, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 757.2337646484375, "y0": 1676.25, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1714.21875, "text": "常用正弦波振荡器主要由决定", "score": 0.9985183339852554, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 685.1162719726562, "y0": 1732.5, "x1": 1820.9669189453125, "y1": 1770.46875, "text": "正反馈放大器组成，这就是反", "score": 0.9970444578390855, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 685.1162719726562, "y0": 1791.5625, "x1": 1820.9669189453125, "y1": 1828.125, "text": "不同，正弦波振荡器可分为LC", "score": 0.991054287978581, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 686.5031127929688, "y0": 1846.40625, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1882.96875, "text": "型。其中LC振荡器和晶体振", "score": 0.9984184503555298, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 686.5031127929688, "y0": 1902.65625, "x1": 1820.9669189453125, "y1": 1939.21875, "text": "于产生低频正弦波（模拟电路", "score": 0.9977528957220224, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 1809.8719482421875, "y0": 1935.0, "x1": 1973.523193359375, "y1": 1988.43